43
00:01:42,950 --> 00:01:44,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The same Jutsu as me?!</font>

44
00:01:45,250 --> 00:01:48,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why have you shown up too?</font>

45
00:01:48,460 --> 00:01:52,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well... I asked you to take care
of them earlier.</font>

46
00:01:53,090 --> 00:01:55,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I kinda felt uneasy, you know.</font>

47
00:01:59,890 --> 00:02:02,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What business does
a Rogue Ninja like you</font>

48
00:02:02,180 --> 00:02:04,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">have in this village now?</font>

49
00:02:10,560 --> 00:02:12,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hatake Kakashi...</font>

50
00:02:13,070 --> 00:02:19,070
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Sharingan vs Sharingan</font>

51
00:02:13,070 --> 00:02:19,070
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">!!<i></i></font>

52
00:02:34,960 --> 00:02:37,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! Why?! Why?!</font>

53
00:02:37,510 --> 00:02:42,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why do I have to go on a research trip
with you, Pervy Sage?</font>

54
00:02:42,680 --> 00:02:46,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh no, this isn't just any research trip.</font>

55
00:02:47,100 --> 00:02:48,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's a woman whose data
I want to collect.</font>

56
00:02:49,020 --> 00:02:50,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So we have to look for her first.</font>

57
00:02:50,690 --> 00:02:54,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I really don't have time to accompany you
on your perverted research trip!</font>

58
00:02:54,820 --> 00:02:56,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because I have training!</font>

59
00:02:57,280 --> 00:02:58,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hm? Training?</font>

60
00:02:58,570 --> 00:03:02,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will take lessons from Kakashi-sensei
and learn a variety of things, like Chidori!</font>

61
00:03:04,370 --> 00:03:07,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi-sensei has been
playing favorites lately!</font>

62
00:03:08,080 --> 00:03:13,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, I think that technique
is impossible for you to learn.</font>

63
00:03:14,590 --> 00:03:18,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">More importantly...
That woman is really beautiful.</font>

64
00:03:18,800 --> 00:03:20,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You want to meet her, don't you?!</font>

65
00:03:20,380 --> 00:03:21,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not at all.</font>

66
00:03:21,880 --> 00:03:26,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not some kid who can
be cajoled by you, Pervy Sage!</font>

67
00:03:26,970 --> 00:03:28,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Anyway, no!</font>

68
00:03:29,810 --> 00:03:31,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, it can't be helped...</font>

69
00:03:32,850 --> 00:03:37,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, well... I know Jutsu more amazing
than Chidori, but...</font>

70
00:03:38,740 --> 00:03:41,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It can't be helped...
Maybe I'll take Sasuke?</font>

71
00:03:43,660 --> 00:03:45,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of course I'll go!</font>

72
00:03:45,620 --> 00:03:48,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll pack my bags right away.</font>

73
00:03:48,290 --> 00:03:51,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Pervy Sage, don't move!</font>

74
00:03:54,630 --> 00:03:58,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll be damned... He's really a cute kid.</font>

75
00:04:11,730 --> 00:04:14,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those eyes are exactly the same
as they used to be in the past.</font>

76
00:04:14,480 --> 00:04:17,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That being said,
he is a true inheritor of the Sharingan...</font>

77
00:04:18,360 --> 00:04:21,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have to assume the worst-case scenario,
just in case.</font>

78
00:04:22,450 --> 00:04:26,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is a surprise...
No wonder you copied my Jutsu...</font>

79
00:04:27,070 --> 00:04:31,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So there really is a fellow
besides Itachi-san who has that eye.</font>

80
00:04:31,950 --> 00:04:35,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your name is Kakashi,
the Copy Ninja, wasn't it?</font>

81
00:04:35,880 --> 00:04:37,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm the one who was surprised.</font>

82
00:04:38,130 --> 00:04:41,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I saw strange men in the tea house
and wondered who they were...</font>

83
00:04:42,510 --> 00:04:44,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There they were Uchiha Itachi and...</font>

84
00:04:45,680 --> 00:04:49,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the Mystery Man of Hidden Mist Village,
Hoshigaki Kisame.</font>

85
00:04:49,890 --> 00:04:54,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, well... You know even my name.
It's an honor.</font>

86
00:04:55,140 --> 00:04:59,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see. You're one of the
"Seven Ninja Swordsmen of the Mist."</font>

87
00:04:59,770 --> 00:05:02,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That huge sword is the "Shark Skin," right?</font>

88
00:05:04,780 --> 00:05:08,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I heard that kid Zabuza
had it out with you?</font>

89
00:05:09,830 --> 00:05:10,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah...</font>

90
00:05:16,250 --> 00:05:18,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are someone who's
well worth lopping off...</font>

91
00:05:19,170 --> 00:05:20,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop it... Kisame.</font>

92
00:05:24,340 --> 00:05:28,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you were to go at it with that man,
it won't end without cost.</font>

93
00:05:29,510 --> 00:05:33,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And if you spend too much time,
another Shinobi would come running.</font>

94
00:05:34,180 --> 00:05:35,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However...</font>

95
00:05:35,520 --> 00:05:40,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't lose sight of the goal...
You didn't come here to get injured!</font>

96
00:05:41,270 --> 00:05:44,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let me hear that "goal" then...?</font>

97
00:05:54,080 --> 00:05:56,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just came to find something
we're looking for.</font>

98
00:05:57,620 --> 00:05:58,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Something you're looking for?</font>

99
00:06:21,900 --> 00:06:24,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The thing you're looking for...
What is it?</font>

100
00:06:27,900 --> 00:06:31,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm different from Kisame,
I won't take time.</font>

101
00:06:34,910 --> 00:06:36,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art: Water Style.
Water wall!</font>

102
00:06:45,460 --> 00:06:49,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's some Jutsu speed.
My eyes couldn't follow the Sign.</font>

103
00:06:50,010 --> 00:06:52,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Shuriken in the right hand
was a decoy...</font>

104
00:06:52,470 --> 00:06:54,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to use a Water Style Jutsu to launch
an attack below my foot ...</font>

105
00:06:55,680 --> 00:06:57,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's what to expect from you, Kakashi-san.</font>

106
00:06:57,810 --> 00:07:01,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your power of analytical eye... is great.</font>

107
00:07:02,810 --> 00:07:05,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A Shadow Clone?!
His Jutsu speed is too fast!</font>

108
00:07:08,820 --> 00:07:10,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A water clone?!</font>

109
00:07:12,280 --> 00:07:16,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Copy Ninja has done well this far
with Jutsu of my village.</font>

110
00:07:18,580 --> 00:07:20,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nice! Kakashi!</font>

111
00:07:20,830 --> 00:07:21,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Get down, Kurenai!</font>

112
00:07:23,170 --> 00:07:24,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This one is the Shadow Clone...</font>

113
00:07:24,590 --> 00:07:25,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

114
00:07:27,600 --> 00:07:29,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi! Kurenai!</font>

115
00:07:29,880 --> 00:07:32,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He made the Shadow Clone
body explode?!</font>

116
00:07:36,010 --> 00:07:38,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A new Jutsu, a new Jutsu.</font>

117
00:07:40,520 --> 00:07:43,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura-chan's going to start to like me...</font>

118
00:07:43,100 --> 00:07:43,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Maybe!</font>

119
00:07:45,150 --> 00:07:48,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi-sensei and Sasuke
will be surprised!</font>

120
00:07:58,830 --> 00:07:59,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi...!</font>

121
00:08:05,920 --> 00:08:07,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't lower your guard...</font>

122
00:08:07,500 --> 00:08:10,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's the guy who became a division chief
of ANBU Black Ops at 13 years old...</font>

123
00:08:11,510 --> 00:08:13,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think he's this powerful...</font>

124
00:08:13,590 --> 00:08:17,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, you haven't seen
this guy's strength yet.</font>

125
00:08:20,520 --> 00:08:22,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I didn't expect that you who are not
a member of the Uchiha clan</font>

126
00:08:22,690 --> 00:08:25,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">would have mastered
the Sharingan to that extent...</font>

127
00:08:25,900 --> 00:08:31,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But your body isn't the "Uchiha clan" body
that goes with the eye.</font>

128
00:08:32,240 --> 00:08:35,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right. As a result,
my stamina doesn't last...</font>

129
00:08:36,700 --> 00:08:41,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's a reason why the Uchiha Clan
was deemed the strongest and feared...</font>

130
00:08:44,080 --> 00:08:49,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll demonstrate the true strength
of Sharingan, the Kekkei Genkai!</font>

131
00:08:51,130 --> 00:08:52,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-It can't be!</font>

132
00:08:52,970 --> 00:08:53,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is bad!</font>

133
00:08:54,380 --> 00:08:56,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Both of you! Don't look at his eyes!</font>

134
00:08:59,510 --> 00:09:02,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Both of you! Don't look at his eyes!</font>

135
00:09:06,690 --> 00:09:09,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Both of you,
absolutely do not open your eyes...</font>

136
00:09:09,570 --> 00:09:11,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's all over now if your eyes meet.</font>

137
00:09:12,610 --> 00:09:16,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Only people with Sharingan
can have a go with that technique.</font>

138
00:09:16,660 --> 00:09:18,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Indeed with Sharingan,</font>

139
00:09:19,160 --> 00:09:22,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you can resist this Mangekyo Sharingan
to a certain extent.</font>

140
00:09:23,540 --> 00:09:24,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However...</font>

141
00:09:26,460 --> 00:09:29,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">this special Visual Jutsu of Sharingan,</font>

142
00:09:29,130 --> 00:09:31,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Genjutsu: Tsukuyomi, Nightmare Realm,
is unbreakable.</font>

143
00:09:32,920 --> 00:09:35,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The only person who can bring me down
is someone</font>

144
00:09:35,220 --> 00:09:38,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">using the same Kekkei Genkai,
a Sharingan user...</font>

145
00:09:44,730 --> 00:09:45,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke...</font>

146
00:10:03,580 --> 00:10:07,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder how much you can take
without the Kekkei Genkai?</font>

147
00:10:24,430 --> 00:10:26,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The one just now was... Genjutsu?</font>

148
00:10:27,350 --> 00:10:29,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In the world of Tsukuyomi...</font>

149
00:10:31,110 --> 00:10:32,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Both space and time...</font>

150
00:10:35,820 --> 00:10:38,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and mass...
I control them all.</font>

151
00:10:41,070 --> 00:10:43,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For the next 72 hours...</font>

152
00:10:43,530 --> 00:10:46,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll stab you continually with swords.</font>

153
00:11:04,140 --> 00:11:05,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's...</font>

154
00:11:06,310 --> 00:11:07,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In the world of Tsukuyomi...</font>

155
00:11:09,230 --> 00:11:11,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Both space and time...</font>

156
00:11:13,770 --> 00:11:17,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and mass...
I control them all.</font>

157
00:11:19,950 --> 00:11:23,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Calm down... This is Genjutsu.</font>

158
00:11:24,580 --> 00:11:28,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's best not to be optimistic
and think it's an illusion.</font>

159
00:11:33,790 --> 00:11:36,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This pain is not an illusion.</font>

160
00:11:39,170 --> 00:11:42,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This pain is absolutely
no different from reality.</font>

161
00:11:50,390 --> 00:11:54,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How long will your spirit sustain?</font>

162
00:12:29,140 --> 00:12:34,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's...
71 hours 59 minutes 59 seconds left.</font>

163
00:12:36,360 --> 00:12:37,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wha...?!</font>

164
00:12:37,480 --> 00:12:39,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">S-Since then...?!</font>

165
00:12:44,070 --> 00:12:46,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's all the time that has passed?!</font>

166
00:13:41,090 --> 00:13:42,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What happened, Kakashi?!</font>

167
00:13:42,380 --> 00:13:44,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you saying we should keep
our eyes closed still?!</font>

168
00:13:46,930 --> 00:13:49,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">N-Not... yet...</font>

169
00:13:49,760 --> 00:13:50,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What happened?!</font>

170
00:13:51,220 --> 00:13:54,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just as that guy finished speaking,
you suddenly fell over!</font>

171
00:13:57,270 --> 00:14:02,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Three days in that world is less than
a moment in the actual world, huh...</font>

172
00:14:03,820 --> 00:14:06,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But... why doesn't he kill me?</font>

173
00:14:07,450 --> 00:14:09,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He could easily do so, if he wants to...</font>

174
00:14:10,530 --> 00:14:15,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Whoa... To take that Jutsu without causing
his spirit to collapse.</font>

175
00:14:16,000 --> 00:14:17,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But Itachi-san...</font>

176
00:14:17,330 --> 00:14:21,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it's also dangerous for you
to overuse those eyes.</font>

177
00:14:25,300 --> 00:14:27,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The thing you're looking for...</font>

178
00:14:27,930 --> 00:14:29,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is it Sasuke?</font>

179
00:14:32,100 --> 00:14:36,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No... the legacy of the Fourth Hokage...</font>

180
00:14:38,310 --> 00:14:40,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">These guys.
What the heck are they planning...?</font>

181
00:14:50,070 --> 00:14:51,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, Naruto, is it...?</font>

182
00:14:52,120 --> 00:14:53,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's been a long time...</font>

183
00:14:55,370 --> 00:14:58,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How many years has it been
since you returned to the village?</font>

184
00:15:04,170 --> 00:15:05,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi...</font>

185
00:15:08,840 --> 00:15:10,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will keep Naruto under my care.</font>

186
00:15:12,590 --> 00:15:14,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was an understandable decision
of the Third Hokage</font>

187
00:15:14,850 --> 00:15:18,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who appointed you to
the role of watching over Naruto...</font>

188
00:15:19,020 --> 00:15:23,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But even at your level,
you may not be able to handle it properly.</font>

189
00:15:23,980 --> 00:15:25,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What in the world are you saying?</font>

190
00:15:28,530 --> 00:15:33,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've been observing Orochimaru
ever since he left the village...</font>

191
00:15:34,700 --> 00:15:39,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was obvious that he would return
to this village sooner or later.</font>

192
00:15:40,500 --> 00:15:44,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All told, at first I was concerned
only about him, but...</font>

193
00:15:46,500 --> 00:15:47,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it?</font>

194
00:15:48,420 --> 00:15:50,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The guy joined an organization.</font>

195
00:15:52,340 --> 00:15:53,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">An organization?</font>

196
00:15:55,430 --> 00:15:57,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are the details of the organization?</font>

197
00:15:58,810 --> 00:16:01,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know much of the details,</font>

198
00:16:01,100 --> 00:16:05,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but it's a small organization known
as Akatsuki made up of nine Shinobi.</font>

199
00:16:06,570 --> 00:16:09,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Until recently, they weren't making
any dramatic moves</font>

200
00:16:09,690 --> 00:16:11,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">except some cloak-and-dagger activities.</font>

201
00:16:11,900 --> 00:16:14,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The biggest concern is
the members of that organization.</font>

202
00:16:15,200 --> 00:16:18,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Almost all of them are listed
on the Bingo Book,</font>

203
00:16:18,490 --> 00:16:22,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">all S-rank deviant criminals.</font>

204
00:16:23,670 --> 00:16:27,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Itachi is among them.</font>

205
00:16:28,800 --> 00:16:32,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If the nine of them get together,
their intent will not be volunteer activities.</font>

206
00:16:33,760 --> 00:16:37,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Since you've been told this much,
you already know what it means.</font>

207
00:16:42,600 --> 00:16:46,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But recently, Orochimaru pulled out
of the organization.</font>

208
00:16:46,980 --> 00:16:48,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And at that time,</font>

209
00:16:48,770 --> 00:16:51,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">other members of the organization
went in to action in different areas,</font>

210
00:16:52,070 --> 00:16:54,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in pairs gathering Jutsu and things.</font>

211
00:16:55,530 --> 00:16:58,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is there proof that one of those
things is the Nine-Tailed Fox?</font>

212
00:16:59,370 --> 00:17:02,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's possible.</font>

213
00:17:02,870 --> 00:17:07,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because it's one of the spirits
who possess the strongest Chakra...</font>

214
00:17:09,550 --> 00:17:10,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi...</font>

215
00:17:10,750 --> 00:17:16,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sooner or later, that Naruto will have
to live watching his back...</font>

216
00:17:18,300 --> 00:17:19,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's his destiny.</font>

217
00:17:23,730 --> 00:17:26,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For now, you should keep
your eyes on Sasuke.</font>

218
00:17:27,400 --> 00:17:30,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's necessary for you to teach him
how to use his Sharingan.</font>

219
00:17:31,530 --> 00:17:35,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll take care of Naruto for a while.</font>

220
00:17:41,950 --> 00:17:46,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Nine-Tailed Fox inside Naruto
is your target?</font>

221
00:17:49,460 --> 00:17:53,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know that you two aren't
the only ones on the move...</font>

222
00:17:55,630 --> 00:17:59,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The name of your organization is
Akatsuki, right?</font>

223
00:18:02,560 --> 00:18:03,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akatsuki?</font>

224
00:18:04,310 --> 00:18:09,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kisame! We'll take Kakashi-san.
Erase the other two.</font>

225
00:18:13,070 --> 00:18:15,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Severe Leaf Hurricanes!</font>

226
00:18:26,250 --> 00:18:27,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who are you?</font>

227
00:18:28,960 --> 00:18:32,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Leaf's noble, blue fierce animal...</font>

228
00:18:32,920 --> 00:18:34,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Might Guy!</font>

229
00:18:35,130 --> 00:18:38,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What a sight...
Shouldn't you be called a strange beast?</font>

230
00:18:39,470 --> 00:18:41,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't underestimate that man...</font>

231
00:18:41,850 --> 00:18:44,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That man is Itachi!</font>

232
00:18:53,440 --> 00:18:55,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You did this to Kakashi...?</font>

233
00:18:55,610 --> 00:18:59,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't look at Itachi's eyes, Guy!
You'll be caught up in his Jutsu!</font>

234
00:19:00,030 --> 00:19:02,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know that already!</font>

235
00:19:02,700 --> 00:19:07,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In order to fight Kakashi,
I devised ways to battle the Sharingan.</font>

236
00:19:10,080 --> 00:19:12,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Open your eyes, both of you!</font>

237
00:19:12,080 --> 00:19:13,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">B-But...</font>

238
00:19:14,340 --> 00:19:16,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When you battle with the Sharingan,</font>

239
00:19:16,420 --> 00:19:18,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it's not a problem if
you don't look at those eyes!</font>

240
00:19:19,260 --> 00:19:21,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You work around it by
gaining insight into his movements</font>

241
00:19:21,550 --> 00:19:23,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">by looking constantly at his feet.</font>

242
00:19:25,010 --> 00:19:28,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now that you mention it,
you're probably right, but...</font>

243
00:19:28,770 --> 00:19:31,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're the only one who can do that.</font>

244
00:19:32,060 --> 00:19:32,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's true...</font>

245
00:19:33,770 --> 00:19:35,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's a knack to reading</font>

246
00:19:35,320 --> 00:19:37,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">all of your opponents' movements
only by his feet.</font>

247
00:19:37,980 --> 00:19:40,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I can't teach it to you
in this emergency.</font>

248
00:19:40,610 --> 00:19:42,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just get used to it right now!</font>

249
00:19:44,200 --> 00:19:44,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What should we do?</font>

250
00:19:45,330 --> 00:19:47,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kurenai, get Kakashi to the medical team.</font>

251
00:19:48,910 --> 00:19:50,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Asuma, you are my back-up!</font>

252
00:19:50,790 --> 00:19:51,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay!</font>

253
00:19:53,330 --> 00:19:57,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And until the reinforcements of
ANBU Black Ops I arranged for arrive,</font>

254
00:19:58,000 --> 00:20:00,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will hang out with you guys.</font>

255
00:20:00,880 --> 00:20:03,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Interesting...
That's some nerve...</font>

256
00:20:05,220 --> 00:20:07,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kisame... Pull the plug.</font>

257
00:20:08,350 --> 00:20:10,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We didn't come to have a war.</font>

258
00:20:11,100 --> 00:20:13,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's too bad,
but no more of this nonsense.</font>

259
00:20:14,400 --> 00:20:15,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're leaving.</font>

260
00:20:16,860 --> 00:20:19,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Too bad... I was finally feeling motivated.</font>

261
00:20:20,440 --> 00:20:22,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It can't be helped.</font>

262
00:20:35,170 --> 00:20:36,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right!</font>

263
00:20:46,090 --> 00:20:48,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here I go!</font>

264
00:20:49,770 --> 00:20:51,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-You're putting too much spirit into it.</font>

265
00:20:52,350 --> 00:20:57,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're not training on a mountain retreat,
you know that, right?</font>

266
00:21:09,670 --> 00:21:14,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">gaman no renzoku dattaro</font></font></b></font>

267
00:21:09,670 --> 00:21:14,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">a cycle of hardship, right?</font></font></b></font>

268
00:21:14,630 --> 00:21:19,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">kokoro de naiteita ndarou</font></font></b></font>

269
00:21:14,630 --> 00:21:19,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">inside, we were crying, right?</font></font></b></font>

270
00:21:19,680 --> 00:21:27,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">jibun de kimeta sono yume dake wa yuzurenai ndarou</font></font></b></font>

271
00:21:19,680 --> 00:21:27,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">but the one thing we won't give up is the dream we've chosen, right?</font></font></b></font>

272
00:21:27,730 --> 00:21:30,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">wakiyaku dakedo</font></font></b></font>

273
00:21:27,730 --> 00:21:30,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">it's a secondary role</font></font></b></font>

274
00:21:33,540 --> 00:21:36,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">kage no hito dakedo</font></font></b></font>

275
00:21:33,540 --> 00:21:36,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">a role in the shadows</font></font></b></font>

276
00:21:36,940 --> 00:21:41,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">yume to mukiau toki kurai</font></font></b></font>

277
00:21:36,940 --> 00:21:41,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">but in reaching for that dream</font></font></b></font>

278
00:21:42,080 --> 00:21:47,720
